{"id":"d085bf2428c43bab","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-boundary.md","title":"Boundary","display":"df-boundary — Boundary","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-boundary","aliases":["58-df-boundary"],"display":"df-boundary — Boundary","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-boundary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-boundary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boundary — Boundary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A,B\\in V,\\ A\\subseteq X\">\\(X,\\tau,A,B\\in V,\\ A\\subseteq X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\)</span> (closure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boundary}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Boundary}_S\\)</span> (boundary predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boundary} \\vdash \\mathrm{Boundary}_S(B,X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists C_A,C_{X\\setminus A}\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C_A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,X\\setminus A,C_{X\\setminus A})\\land B=C_A\\cap C_{X\\setminus A}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boundary} \\vdash \\mathrm{Boundary}_S(B,X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists C_A,C_{X\\setminus A}\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C_A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,X\\setminus A,C_{X\\setminus A})\\land B=C_A\\cap C_{X\\setminus A}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Boundary points meet both the set and its complement in every neighborhood.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S$ (closure predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,A,B\\in V,\\ A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boundary}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boundary} \\vdash \\mathrm{Boundary}_S(B,X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists C_A,C_{X\\setminus A}\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C_A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,X\\setminus A,C_{X\\setminus A})\\land B=C_A\\cap C_{X\\setminus A}\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1071,"backlinks":[{"id":"79b0dd4e332e49b7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-boundary.md|58-df-boundary]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["9ac97ecaeb21258a","74086485fba8d86f"]}